{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "(This guy seems to know quite a bit about Kiriko... I should dig a little deeper.)": "",
  "So people really like Kiriko-san, huh?": "",
  "Oh yeah. You should see how many customers hit on her. But if they knew about her past...": "",
  "Why? What about it?": "",
  "Well, apparently Kiriko-chan is already on her fourth husband. She's been divorced three times.": "",
  "Three divorces? At her age!?": "",
  "(Her husband must know about it, but would he have told his mother?)": "",
  "Apparently, all three of the previous husbands ran away from her.": "",
  "Because they were all almost murdered. In fact, her second husband actually died.": "",
  "You're sure all of this is true? It's a little hard to believe.": "",
  "Oh, I'm sure. That's the story that put this café on the map. Apparently there was poison found in his food.": "",
  "And she wasn't charged?": "",
  "As I recall, the incident happened at his workplace, so there wasn't enough proof to arrest her.": "",
  "Oh, but I assure you, it wasn't here at this café.": "",
  "And have you ever met her current husband?": "",
  "I've spoken with him. I believe his name is Kojiro.": "",
  "He's just your run-of-the-mill salaryman, really. But he's madly in love with Kiriko-chan.": "",
  "He swings by after work every day, and she makes him coffee.": "",
  "He comes by for coffee every day? So he'll show up today too?": "",
  "Oh, I'm sure he will.": "",
  "(Hm. Maybe the mother's suspicions weren't completely off the mark...)": "",
  "Anyway... Kiriko-chan is clearly the kind of woman who's out of reach for most guys.": "",
  "Haha, but that wouldn't stop me from trying! I think I could tame the devil in her... Heh.": "",
  "I gather you've got your own little crush on her?": "",
  "What? Oh no, she's married! I'm just saying... I think we'd have been a good match.": "",
  "Better than that dull-ass husband she's got, anyway.": "",
  "(In other words, this guy's crushing on Kiriko-chan hard.)": "",
  "(He wasn't wrong when he called her an enchantress.)": "",
  "Oh, speak of the devil. There's her husband now.": "",
  "Well, I better get back to work. Don't want my manager to see me slacking off.": "",
  "(Maybe if I get closer, I'll be able to hear Kojiro-san's conversation...)": "",
  "Hey, you're looking pretty rough, man. You under the weather?": "",
  "Yeah, I guess. But maybe I'm just tired. It's just been a lot of stomachaches and nausea lately.": "",
  "Doesn't seem like coffee would be the best cure, then. You must really love your wife.": "",
  "I beg to differ, Hirasawa. Coffee made with love is the best medicine I could ask for.": "",
  "(Stomach pains and nausea line up with what Shizue-san told me...)": "",
  "Here you go. One hot cup of coffee, black, like you like it.": "",
  "Thanks, Kiriko-chan!": "",
  "Oh, I see you have a guest?": "",
  "Nice to meet you. I'm Hirasawa.": "",
  "This guy's incredible, Kiriko. He's from our ad agency, and he's done all kinds of commercials you'd know.": "",
  "Incredible! It sounds like you really know your stuff. You have to be so clever to work on ads these days.": "",
  "I can see it in your eyes. They're quite clever and very lovely.": "",
  "Lovely, you say? Oh, ha ha... You think so?": "",
  "Ah, Ko-chan! Why don't we invite Hirasawa-san over to our house for dinner?": "",
  "Ah, that's a great idea! Kiriko is a lovely cook!": "",
  "I'll let you work out the details, then. I'll be looking forward to seeing you, Hirasawa-san.": "",
  "...Of course, I'd be happy to come.": "",
  "(An enchantress indeed... She was flirting with that guy with her husband sitting right there...)": "",
  "(Is he that confident, or just dense? He doesn't seem the slightest bit concerned.)": "",
  "(Shizue-san suspects Kiriko of poisoning his food... And considering he drinks coffee here daily...)": "",
  "(It'd be pretty tough to poison coffee, but I should check it out, just in case.)": "",
  "(This is bad. That guy could be in serious danger soon.)": "",
  "(I think I need to talk to the guy. Hopefully he hasn't gotten far.)": "",
  "Hey, you're Kojiro Kuwayama-san, right? Can I talk to you for a sec?": "",
  "Hm? Who are you?": "",
  "I'm Yagami, the detective your mother hired.": "",
  "Oh, right, Mom did mention something about that. She can be so dramatic.": "",
  "Well, her worries may not be as unfounded as you think.": "",
  "(This is going to have to be convincing... How should I lead into this...)": "",
  "That cup of coffee you just drank. Did you add sugar, by any chance?": "",
  "No, I take my coffee black.": "",
  "Well, that's a bit strange, because there was a white substance on the edge of your cup.": "",
  "And to make matters worse, it smelled of garlic, which is not far off from... a poison called arsenic.": "",
  "A-Arsenic?": "",
  "I haven't run any tests or anything, but I understand you've been feeling ill for some time, am I right?": "",
  "You should know, nausea and stomach pains are symptoms consistent with the ingestion of arsenic.": "",
  "No way... It could be a coincidence, right?": "",
  "Sir, you're aware your wife has been divorced three times, aren't you?": "",
  "Yes, I'm aware. I didn't tell my mother that, though.": "",
  "Were you also aware her second husband died of poisoning?": "",
  "I'm guessing that's new to you, then.": "",
  "Well... I'm sure it wasn't something she wanted to talk about.": "",
  "Listen, detective. I know what you're getting at, but I trust my wife, and I'm not going to stop.": "",
  "(Hm. Doesn't sound like I'm going to get through to him...)": "",
  "Is it true that you've been in a series of unfortunate accidents lately, sir?": "",
  "Have you considered the possibility... that someone could be causing them?": "",
  "You're a persistent one, aren't you!?": "",
  "That said, uh...": "",
  "Have you noticed anything unusual?": "",
  "Well, sometimes, on my commute home from work... I feel like I'm being followed by a man...": "",
  "That's interesting. When was the most recent time you've felt that?": "",
  "Hmm, let's see...": "",
  "Oh, I remember now. It was the one day I headed straight home without visiting Kiriko-chan at the café.": "",
  "(In other words, on days Kiriko-san is off duty.)": "",
  "And do you ever feel endangered when you're being followed?": "",
  "Well, I wrote it all off, but I did notice that a brick fell from a window once, and I got pushed into the street...": "",
  "You wrote all that off as coincidence? You don't think the stalker might have anything to do with it?": "",
  "But who would be out to get me?": "",
  "I don't know, but I think maybe it's time we find out.": "",
  "Well, the ideal way would be to lure him into a place where he thinks you're alone...": "",
  "Maybe I could bait him into an alley?": "",
  "Huh? Are you sure you want to take that risk?": "",
  "If it'll prove my wife is innocent in all this, I'll do anything.": "",
  "Fair enough. Then I'll follow the stalker from behind.": "",
  "But can you give me any more details on the guy you think is following you?": "",
  "Well, he was smallish, about 5'2\". But he wore a hoodie and sunglasses to hide his face.": "",
  "That's pretty suspicious. And where is the company you work for located, Kojiro-san?": "",
  "It's called Kita Electric, right here in Kamurocho. So I should just find the nearest alley, right?": "",
  "Yeah, that'd be great. Don't try to drag him too far.": "",
  "(Nice, Kojiro-san is off from work.)": "",
  "Kojiro-san, you just need to act natural. Start walking when I give the signal.": "",
  "Kojiro-san, I've got the guy in my sights. Start walking, and don't look back.": "",
  "O-Okay, but you'll save me if something goes wrong, right...?": "",
  "Hey, what do you think you're doing!?": "",
  "Wait... Aren't you the other waiter at the café?": "",
  "Tch...": "",
  "That explains how easy it was to get poison into your coffee, Kojiro-san.": "",
  "Shit! You're dead!": "",
  "Y-Yagami-san!": "",
  "Stay back! And go call the cops!": "",
  "Haaaaaaaah!": "",
  "Why? Why were you trying to kill Kojiro-san!?": "",
  "Because he was in the way between me and Kiriko-chan!": "",
  "In the way? What's your relationship with her, anyway?": "",
  "My relationship!? It's destiny! Destiny that we would be together!": "",
  "I just need him gone, and then Kiriko-chan will be mine!": "",
  "Stop your squirming!": "",
  "Let go of me! Damn you!": "",
  "What in the world just happened?": "",
  "I'm not completely sure myself... But I'm sure the cops are going to take their time finding out.": "",
  "Well... Apparently, Kiriko-chan rejected that waiter three years back.": "",
  "He's been stalking her ever since... Even getting jobs at the same place she does.": "",
  "Didn't that bother Kiriko-chan?": "",
  "Well... People confess their love to her all the time. She didn't think much of it, I guess.": "",
  "Th-That's... a unique problem to have.": "",
  "I guess he finally snapped though, and convinced himself I was the problem...": "",
  "And that certainly explains why I've had so many near-fatal encounters.": "",
  "And you kept surviving them, so he finally resorted to poison.": "",
  "Do you think he killed her second husband as well?": "",
  "I'd be willing to bet on it, but I suppose we'll find out after they interrogate him...": "",
  "He's probably tried to kill every guy who got between him and Kiriko-chan.": "",
  "And here I was suspecting Kiriko-san... I'm such a horrible mother.": "",
  "That's not true, Mom. You just didn't get a chance to get to know her yet.": "",
  "I think she's easily misunderstood.": "",
  "I can see why.": "",
  "But I'm impressed, Kojiro-san. Your trust in Kiriko-san didn't waiver for a moment.": "",
  "Of course not. I'm her husband.": "",
  "Yagami-san, thank you for getting to the bottom of this.": "",
  "No problem. I hope you two have a wonderful future together. Free of accidents.": "",
  "Excuse me, Are you Shizue Kuwayama-san?": "",
  "Yes, I am. And you are?": "",
  "I'm Yagami, from Yagami Detective Agency. I came to discuss your case?": "",
  "Oh yes, thank you for your time.": "",
  "Welcome, sir. Please, take any seat you like.": "",
  "Oh, I didn't mean to stare. Please forgive my rudeness.": "",
  "Welcome, sir. It's good to see you back again.": "",
  "I apologize for staring at you last time... You just seem like you have such a big heart.": "",
  "Hehe... Sorry, don't mind me...": "",
  "So many people with big hearts seem to come here.": "",
  "You look pretty well-off, too.": "",
  "...Oh! Sir, sorry, can I help you with anything?": "",
  "Oh, sir! You're back again.": "",
  "Please take your time, and just let me know if I can get you anything.": "",
  "(Here's what's left of the coffee Kojiro-san was drinking.)": "",
  "(She makes this for him personally, every time he comes in...)": "",
  "(Let's get a closer look.)": "",
  "Hm? What's this white powder?": "",
  "Sugar?": "",
  "Yeah, it must be sugar.": "",
  "I guess Kojiro-san takes sugar in his coffee.": "",
  "(No wait, something's not right about that...)": "",
  "(I hear real coffee lovers put salt in their coffee to increase the flavor.)": "",
  "(From what I can gather, Kojiro-san must be a real coffee aficionado.)": "",
  "(Wait, is that even relevant?)": "",
  "(Something's off about this.)": "",
  "(Kiriko-san made a point of saying it was black coffee when she brought it out.)": "",
  "In that case, what's this powder? It could be anything...)": "",
  "(Something has a strong scent here...)": "",
  "(I didn't see anyone smoking, and there's nothing in the ash tray.)": "",
  "(That pretty much rules out a poison cigarette.)": "",
  "(This is the water that Kojiro-san's friend was drinking.)": "",
  "(Wait, he came to a café and only ordered water? What a cheap ass.)": "",
  "(If he's making such big waves at an ad agency, he probably makes big money too. How stingy can he be?)": "",
  "...I could never be friends with a guy like that.": "",
  "(Okay. Now to find our guy.)": "",
  "(Smells almost like garlic, but... could it be poison?)": "",
  "(Let's see... If she knows he'd come here to drink coffee every day...)": "",
  "(Isn't it possible she could be mixing tiny doses of poison into each cup, and that would explain why he feels so ill?)": "",
  "Minami-kun? You work with Kiriko-chan, right?": "",
  "(And if it's not sugar, it could have been introduced by someone else.)": "",
  "(I had eyes on her husband's friend the whole time, so it couldn't have been him.)": "",
  "(...That would mean it was added prior to being served.)": "",
  "Well, look who it is!": "",
  "Hey, good to see you. Hitting the poker tables again, are we?": "",
  "Yup. I'm all out of martinis, too, so I wouldn't mind playing with you for a bit.": "",
  "Ready to get started?": "",
  "Sure, I'll take you on.": "",
  "How about next time?": "",
  "Oh, all right. Swing by again sometime.": "",
  "Oh? I won't go down easy, you know!": "",
  "Hope you don't mind losing! ...Wait, you don't have enough chips.": "",
  "Head over to the exchange counter and buy some first.": "",
  "Oh, were you leaving already?": "",
  "Today's just not my day... I'm out.": "",
  "If you say so. Well, see you later then.": "",
  "Aww... I can't believe I lost!": "",
  "Don't worry. We all have those days.": "",
  "Hehe, you're sweet. Either way, I did have fun.": "",
  "Hope to see you again!": "",
  "Ah, you again. Feelin' like some poker today?": "",
  "Yeah, I'll take you on.": "",
  "Thanks for the invite, but I'm gonna pass for now.": "",
  "Hehe, I've got some new tricks up my sleeve... Better watch out!": "",
  "Hehe, don't think it'll be as easy as last time! ...Wait, you don't have enough chips.": "",
  "...Today's just not my lucky day.": "",
  "We all have days like that. Hope to see you again next time.": "",
  "Aww, not again! I gotta say, you're one tough guy... I like that. ❤": "",
  "(She's not... actually hitting on me, is she? Okay... calm down. You're cool. You're the man. You got this!)": "",
  "Heh, what can I say? I guess Lady Luck likes her guys tough. Rugged, even. With the faintest hint of danger about them.": "",
  "Hee-hee... With an attitude like that, I feel like the two of us were meant to be... poker buddies.": "",
  "...Huh? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Poker buddies</font_kind>?": "",
  "Totally! Come play with me again whenever you have the chance, yeah? Oh, and you can have this if you want.": "",
  "Oh shoot, I'm gonna be late! I promised to meet up with my boyfriend... Well, see you later!": "",
  "Wait... What just happened...": "",
  "(Looks like I didn't get lucky after all...)": "",
  "So this job... I understand your nephew has gone missing?": "",
  "Yes, I'm afraid so. His name is Hideaki Deguchi.": "",
  "Three years ago, he left home in hopes of becoming the number one host in Kamurocho, and I haven't heard from him since.": "",
  "(He sure set his sights high, didn't he?)": "",
  "And his parents... I'm sorry to ask, but they're both gone?": "",
  "Yes. They were in a tragic accident while Hideaki was in high school... I'm the only family he's got left.": "",
  "You must be worried sick, then.": "",
  "Yes, to say the least. Do you think you can find him, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I can try. I'm usually pretty good at tracking people down.": "",
  "Um, there <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> one more thing I think you should know... It's embarrassing, but...": "",
  "I lent Hideaki some money at one point. To the tune of 500,000 yen.": "",
  "500,000? That's not exactly pocket change.": "",
  "Yes. He told me he'd need a nest egg to kick off living here in Tokyo, and that he'd pay it back in a year...": "",
  "But I couldn't bring myself to bug him about it, and now three years have flown by.": "",
  "Understandable. Money can be a tough subject between family.": "",
  "Right, so I stayed quiet, but now I'm in a situation where I could really use that money...": "",
  "Oh yes, but my daughter is getting married soon. And I'd like to be able to help her out...": "",
  "Ah, I see.": "",
  "Yes. I'd actually always planned that the 500,000 would go toward her. That's why I saved it.": "",
  "So, correct me if I'm wrong, but you're hoping I can find your nephew and get your money back in the process?": "",
  "...Yes. It's a tough thing to ask, but...": "",
  "I assure you, it's not about the money. It's more important to me that he's safe.": "",
  "You'll be discreet about the money issue, I hope?": "",
  "Of course. He's your family, so I'll make sure things stay... amicable.": "",
  "But, if he's not paying you back, there's clearly an issue. If he has it, I'll get it back somehow.": "",
  "I believe you've made an offer of 120,000 yen, correct?": "",
  "Yes. I did some research and thought that would be an appropriate amount.": "",
  "(So, Hideaki set out to become the number one host in Kamurocho, huh?)": "",
  "(I guess the best place to start asking around would be Stardust.)": "",
  "Hey, Seiya. I've got a request for you.": "",
  "Yagami-san, what's up?": "",
  "I'm looking for a guy. Goes by Hideaki Deguchi. Word on the streets is that he's a host. Heard of him?": "",
  "Deguchi? That's not the kinda name a host would use. You know what his stage name is?": "",
  "No, not really. But I've got a picture. I'll text you.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
